hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"281","On the authority of Yunus bin Muadh, on the authority of Abdul Wahhab, meaning Al-Thaqafi, on the authority of Ayyub, on the authority of Anas ibn Sirin, on the authority of Anas ibn Malik, he said: “The Messenger of God was May God’s prayers and peace be upon him, he would go to so-and-so’s mother, and she would spread a blanket for him, and it would be said about him, so she would take some of his sweat and put it in her perfume.” Muhammad ibn al-Walid told us, Abd al-Wahhab told us something similar, and he said: He goes to Umm Sulaim."
